# Source

N. Seiberg and E. Witten,
“Electric-Magnetic Duality, Monopole Condensation, And Confinement
In N=2 Supersymmetric Yang-Mills Theory,”
*Nucl. Phys.* B426 (1994) 19–52,
[arXiv:hep-th/9407087](https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9407087).

This library formalizes statements from that paper as they wrote them.
It is not a formalization of *From Geometric Flux to Magnetic Charge*,
and it does not import
https://github.com/dicipler-pixel/geometric-flux-magnetic-charge-lean
-/

/-- The arXiv identifier of the source paper (hep-th/9407087). -/
def SeibergWitten.arxivId : String := "hep-th/9407087"
